00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:18.620
Yokoi is the guy who's like really, you know, making sure that they're doing a good job.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:19.920
Good old Gunpei. Yeah.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:23.160
Good old Gunpei before they gave him the boot after the virtual boy.

