00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:55.720
Like Nintendo doesn't publish books on like how they do these things.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:04:00.300
That'd be cool. Where are we getting all these really weird, like ambiguous quotes from?

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:08.300
And that's the problem. Yeah. Those ambiguous quotes come from like game magazines in like the late 90s or early 2000s.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:11.760
So those come from like the early 90s and the 2000s.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:19.780
And what's funny about that is like, I don't know why they're able to like feel so much more comfortable talking to their boss about these games when he's asking them questions.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:24.240
