00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:27.260
Anybody who runs them.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.820
It makes sense. It's like it's more of like an internal thing where you feel more comfortable.

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:33.600
Like your boss will censor anything that needs to be censored.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.620
Right. As opposed to you being a representative of the company.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.660
And the brand.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:45.860
Right. So Sakamoto also talked about with Iwata, like how did the how did the fish come into play?

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:53.660
And the interesting here that I learned is not that the the fish and balloon fight, it's not waiting for you at all times when you're at the water.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.380
