00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:02.040
And that's why when you go down at certain points into the water, it doesn't eat you.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:05.820
It's actually it is swimming down and you don't know you might get lucky.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:09.580
You might not. Wow. If you wait down there long enough, though, you're going to get swallowed.

