00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.100
B is kind of like your turbo button.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:28.180
You know, before that ever existed, you used them to pay extra for a controller that would

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:30.280
do turbo. But they usually don't want.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:34.520
