00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:39.680
That's kind of cool. And also, this is another game where you can, you know, scroll over to the other side of

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.020
the screen. Another wraparound game.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:44.880
That trips you up way more in this game than other games that we've played, I think.

