where... Yeah, but when you're not expecting an enemy, you think like, oh, that guy is all the way

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.500
on the other side of the screen. I don't have to worry about him.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.120
Then he comes over and bonks you in the head.

