I was just going to say it was pretty much like once you play it for a couple of minutes,

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.570
you kind of have the idea of it.

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.450
Yeah. This was a mode that I tried for a while.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:02.430
Like I was like, oh, there's like a thing here, like a pattern I can figure out.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:05.550
