I can't think of what I think if you if you saw it, you would you would you would probably recognize it because even though it's not like a big game in their catalog and stuff like that,

00:22:49.670 --> 00:23:00.810
I think it is thought of fondly by people who are a fan of the balloon fight franchise, because personally, I think that's like a really cool like next step for that game is not to just like add more elements to the arcade mode.

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.890
Kind of like what we were talking about with Mario Brothers.

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:08.750
Yeah, like another if they made a how they make a new Super Mario Brothers, they made a new Mario Brothers.

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:11.950
What would it be if they made a new a modern day balloon fight?

