What would you add? I think the joke is always just it's an open world balloon fight.

00:23:18.490 --> 00:23:27.730
But I think like it'd be like the beginning of, well, you know, like Fortnite or something or players unknown battleground where you're all jumping from the plane.

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:29.250
But it just you just stay there.

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:30.310
Just stay in the air.

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:36.150
So it's like a battle royale game, but in the sky and you have to keep pressing the button to stay.

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.130
For like 40 minutes.

00:23:38.630 --> 00:23:47.630
Yeah. What's funny is that we don't have to we don't have to answer that question necessarily because I think they took the next logical step with it with this platforming game.

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:54.370
I think definitely like even a 3D platformer with the balloon, the balloon fight model would be like a cool thing to do.

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:55.390
Yeah, I think not.

00:23:55.570 --> 00:23:58.290
I think there are. I'm just trying to figure out what I'm thinking of it.

