Not to make this a Pokemon podcast, but.

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.810
Okay, so interesting, interesting thing here.

00:24:31.030 --> 00:24:33.190
Since Joe axed it earlier, I took the time to look it up.

00:24:34.310 --> 00:24:36.290
It's Sakamoto Joint, Balloon Kid.

