00:24:50.750 --> 00:24:53.350
Because Nintendo does feel fondly about this game, too.

00:24:53.510 --> 00:24:56.650
More so than a lot of their arcade games.

00:24:56.830 --> 00:25:01.270
And this being, you know, brought to the NES, it also gets its own Game Boy game.

00:25:01.390 --> 00:25:03.310
It gets so many ports.

00:25:03.530 --> 00:25:05.010
It's got character in this game.

00:25:05.130 --> 00:25:07.830
Yeah, it's got that really weird kind of.

00:25:07.970 --> 00:25:11.710
Oh, yeah, this is like an awkward seeming, but there's more to it.

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:12.850
Nintendo game.

00:25:13.230 --> 00:25:18.270
Right. And I think, like, they're really proud of what they were able to accomplish with the controls and stuff like that, too.

00:25:18.470 --> 00:25:22.030
That they brought it to e-reader.

00:25:22.170 --> 00:25:24.070
They brought it, you know, there was an e-reader version.

