The verse system, it's usually just, like, a blue cabinet with some decal stuff on the side.

00:26:55.730 --> 00:26:59.610
I see. The ones that got, like, the special treatment are the ones that aren't under the verse system name.

00:26:59.610 --> 00:27:02.410
Like, Mario Brothers, Donkey Kong, The Young Junior.

00:27:02.410 --> 00:27:07.650
Like, those are their own standalone arcade games before they develop the verse system line.

00:27:07.770 --> 00:27:09.150
And those are beautiful cabinets.

00:27:09.370 --> 00:27:14.970
I mean, like, whenever you see a Donkey Kong cabinet, that pops out not just from sound, but also from the visuals.

00:27:15.550 --> 00:27:19.090
All right, guys. So, I think we've exhausted what we can talk about Balloon Fight here.

